  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2501.07 Lasting medical necessity",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2501.07 “Lasting medical necessity” means after market tinting that will alleviate a medical condition defined in Saf-C 2501.08, the latter of which is likely to last for at least 4 years.\n\nSource. #14382, eff 9-20-25, EXPIRES: 9-20-35",
